{"id":"2f9850d6fe4ddc35","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-recursive-axiomatization.md","title":"Recursive Axiomatization","display":"df-recursive-axiomatization — Recursive Axiomatization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-recursive-axiomatization","aliases":["92-df-recursive-axiomatization"],"display":"df-recursive-axiomatization — Recursive Axiomatization","depends_on":["[[92-df-axiomatization]]","[[92-df-recursive-set]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]"],"source":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义","source_status":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-recursive-axiomatization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-recursive-axiomatization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-axiomatization — Recursive Axiomatization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a8fad09f2abacecd\" href=\"?note=a8fad09f2abacecd\" title=\"92-df-axiomatization\">92-df-axiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d4d93aba49d678d8\" href=\"?note=d4d93aba49d678d8\" title=\"92-df-recursive-set\">92-df-recursive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T,A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (theory and axiom-set parameters, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G\\)</span> (axiomatization predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a8fad09f2abacecd\" href=\"?note=a8fad09f2abacecd\" title=\"92-df-axiomatization\">92-df-axiomatization</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecSet}\">\\(\\mathrm{RecSet}\\)</span> (recursive-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d4d93aba49d678d8\" href=\"?note=d4d93aba49d678d8\" title=\"92-df-recursive-set\">92-df-recursive-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G\\)</span> (Gödel-code image, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RecAx}_G\\)</span> (definition-target recursive-axiomatization predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}axiomatization} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G(A,T)\\land\\mathrm{RecSet}(\\mathrm{Code}_G(A))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}axiomatization} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G(A,T)\\land\\mathrm{RecSet}(\\mathrm{Code}_G(A))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>递归可公理化：存在递归公理集</li>\n<li>递归公理化只是Gödel不完备性定理的有效性前提之一；还需足够算术强度与相应一致性条件</li>\n<li>PA递归可公理化</li>\n<li>按本定义，“递归公理化”就是存在成员关系可判定的公理码集，而不是断言闭合理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>本身可判定</li>\n<li>Craig技巧说明c.e.公理化的理论可换用递归公理集公理化；这一等价涉及更换公理呈现</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"a8fad09f2abacecd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiomatization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"d4d93aba49d678d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (theory and axiom-set parameters, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"a8fad09f2abacecd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G$ (axiomatization predicate, see [[92-df-axiomatization]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"d4d93a